    <DataNode elementId="AT1G50430-MONOMER" textLabel="sterol Δ⁷ reductase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9LDU6" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="600" centerY="475" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">Mutant &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis&lt;/i&gt; plants with lesions in the &lt;i&gt;DWF5&lt;/i&gt; gene were shown to be deficient in the &amp;Delta;&lt;sup&gt;7&lt;/sup&gt; reduction step converting 5-dehydroepisterol to 24-methylenecholesterol |CITS:[10758495]|. When expressed into yeast, the DWF5 gene was shown to encode a sterol &amp;Delta;&lt;sup&gt;7&lt;/sup&gt; reductase which, whilst being highly specific for the &amp;Delta;7-bond reduction in a &amp;Delta;5,7 structure, can tolerate a large variety of sterol side chains |CITS:[8631902]|. It was emphasized that this enzymes lacks any &amp;Delta;8-, &amp;Delta;14-, &amp;Delta;24(25)-, or &amp;Delta;24(28)-reductase activities. It was also noted that the yeast strains encoding DWF5 were highly resistant to the antifungal polyene drug nystatin (up to 80 &amp;mu;g/ml compared to 2 &amp;mu;g/ml for the parental strain) |CITS:[8631902]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT1G50430-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT1G50430.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Arrayexpress" value="Q9LDU6" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pride" value="Q9LDU6" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Interpro" value="IPR018083" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pfam" value="PF01222" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Phylomedb" value="Q9LDU6" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Prosite" value="PS01018" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_String" value="3702.AT1G50430.1-P" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q9LDU6" />
